{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/115","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/115/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/115/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/115/events","html_url":"https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/issues/115","id":6233398670,"node_id":"I_kwDORtdXRM8AAAABc4odjg","number":115,"title":"[RUST-R2-FIX] 修复创建用户初始角色与组织关联失败","user":{"login":"wangzishi","id":8288105,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyODgxMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8288105?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi","html_url":"https://github.com/wangzishi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-11-05T23:16:26Z","updated_at":"2026-11-05T23:30:54Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"parent_issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/57","issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"状态：#115 G1已冻结 / 限定G2准入，实现与验收尚未完成。\n\n父#57；总体#57。\n\n修复#57已登记的POST /api/platform/users携带非空initialRoleIds返回500；同时核对同根因primaryOrgUnitId。用户UUID物化后写真实角色/组织关联，验证角色/组织有效性、重复关系、唯一用户名并发、必要审计/会话及业务写整体回滚。不增加公开路由，不计入R4新增25；后续独立验收和G3/G4。\n\n基线 main aaa4b16ac66092f0cb1dc6646a02cf14e80823ee；分支 codex/poms-r4ghi-next25；2026-11-06（Asia/Tokyo）。Rust 正式240，R4已交付67/92、余25。用户已授权：建立父子Issue、复核归属与联合G1、三线并行实现、补缺和验收准备、统一候选真实阶段验收及独立G3/G4。\n\n以业务语义、正确性和合理性为准，不追Node缺陷级对齐。必要事实/版本/快照/审计/会话写入同一外层事务整体提交或回滚。Root单一维护DDL/迁移、公共路由/契约/生成物、Git/GitHub及受控环境；作者独立worktree与写入范围。子代理显式gpt-6.1-sol/max，Fast未核实。\n\n经营评价须消费真实经营快照和合同/资金/成本/税务分摊事实。移交事实不自动进入execution，仍需同一事实链上的有效提成角色冻结；联合G1核清最小R5依赖归属和交付顺序。相应内部producer、审批和敏感视图纳入实际验收，不能用改库或合成映射fixture冒充生产交付。完整阶段未通过前#101保持Open，#57持续Open。无生产部署、切流、性能或完整R5–R7交付结论。\n\n- [x] G0：原生父子Issue及范围\n- [x] G1：#115创建关联、14来源、typed UUID、锁内校验及必要写整体事务冻结\n- [ ] G2：限定实现及文件交付\n- [ ] 统一候选真实HTTP/PG/权限/必要写故障/并发/原UI验收\n- [ ] 非作者G3、固定提交及main集成\n- [ ] 精确清理、生命周期归档、独立G4及线上实际读回\n\n\nG1 已冻结，仅限 #115 用户创建关联修复；R4 #110 的 G1 仍 Pending。\n\n- Input commit: [21e9124160f92dce38a5029786273fdb893759f0](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/commit/21e9124160f92dce38a5029786273fdb893759f0)。\n- Baseline: [限定实施基线](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/21e9124160f92dce38a5029786273fdb893759f0/docs/design/rust-r4ghi-user-create-fix-baseline.md)。\n- Source manifest: `docs/design/rust-r4ghi/user-fix-g1-sources01.json` SHA256 `d0d7afb52c50f82896137e7fe794e2da6d633b82e907cec88e5ca5610ca92462`；14原始来源及基线已核，原产品source aaa4b16a。\n- 保留既有 POST /api/platform/users、请求/返回、权限/CSRF及成功状态；无新增route/DDL/生成契约。\n- UUID生成后写真实角色/主组织关联；引用在TX内锁定并复核，typed UUID去重、未知404/停用或重复409；用户名唯一竞态409。用户、关联、必要审计与待刷新认证会话整体提交或回滚。\n- 旧W01复制Node缺陷的500仅保留历史参考，已superseded，不纳入当前验收证书。真实成功/拒绝、due/non-due、逐必要写故障回滚与重试、受控并发及独立G3/G4均待执行。\n- 本读回允许 #115 限定G2；不代表实现/验收/G3/G4完成，不计R4新25；#57保持Open。\n\n<!-- user-create-G1-21e91241 -->\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/11